    "created_at": "2023-06-06T21:19:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-06T21:19:24Z",
    "body": "> I just noticed a small bug here on the spec, the \"is modal\" check will never be true, since we set is modal to false beforehand. We need to store whether the dialog was modal in a variable and use that.\r\n\r\nI opened a spec PR to fix this here: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9391",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
